<BaseLayout title="About Flowin | Pipes & fittings since 2013" description="Meet Flowin Pipe Pvt. Ltd., established in 2013, with uPVC, cPVC, SWR and agriculture pipes and fittings."><SiteHeader /><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><section class="wrap simple-hero"><p class="kicker">About Flowin</p><h1>Pipes and fittings.<br />Since 2013.</h1><p>Flowin Pipe Pvt. Ltd. manufactures pipes and fittings for plumbing, drainage and agricultural applications.</p></section><section class="wrap editorial-split"><figure><img src="/images/flowin-product-group-legacy.jpg" alt="Flowin legacy product assortment with pipes and fittings" width="500" height="500" /></figure><div><p class="kicker">One catalogue, four ranges</p><h2>A product reference for the people doing the work.</h2><p>Dealers need to answer product enquiries. Plumbers need a clear reference for their next requirement. Our website brings the catalogue ranges and their product families into one place.</p><p>Browse uPVC, cPVC, SWR and agriculture. Compare the available sizes, packing and printed rates, then use the full PDF for the complete list.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products/">Explore the product directory</a></div></section><section class="about-values"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Our stated vision</p><h2>Strong products. Dependable quality. Lasting value.</h2><p>Flowin's stated vision is to become a trusted and progressive name in the piping industry.</p><div class="value-grid"><div><h3>Start with the range</h3><p>Four catalogue systems for plumbing, drainage and agricultural requirements.</p></div><div><h3>Check the details</h3><p>Product tables keep printed sizes, variants, packing and rates together.</p></div><div><h3>Keep a clear reference</h3><p>The official 2026 catalogue remains the source for the complete product list.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="catalogue-banner"><div class="wrap"><div><h2>Find your next product reference.</h2><p>Choose a range and explore its families, or open the complete catalogue.</p></div><a class="solid-btn" href="/products/">Browse products</a></div></section></main><SiteFooter /></BaseLayout>
